{"id":"n14484-2-7","stage":4,"title":"병아리 · 雏鸡","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14484-2-7-1","ko":"저 사람은 못 보던 배우 같은데? 연기가 좀 별로다.","zh":"那个人好像是没见过的演员吧？演技有点差啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람은","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보던","meaning":"(做)过","explanation":"보다：(做)过；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배우","meaning":"演员","explanation":"배우：演员","readings":[{"term":"배우","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58204","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같은데?","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；은데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"연기가","meaning":"演技","explanation":"연기：演技；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"연기","audio":"/audio/8b0e2bb594ceb0c31f20.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67479","senseId":"1","lemma":"연기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"별로다.","meaning":"特别，格外","explanation":"별로：特别，格外；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"별로","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58301","senseId":"1","lemma":"별로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"(做)过","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"表示经历过前面所指的行为。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"70129359d515b770","term":"배우","zh":"演员","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3","entryId":"58204","definition":"担任电影、话剧或电视剧等中的人物角色进行表演的人。","pronunciation":["배우"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"8b0e2bb594ceb0c3","term":"연기","zh":"演技","audio":"/audio/8b0e2bb594ceb0c31f20.mp3","entryId":"67479","definition":"演员根据扮演的角色表现人物、性格、行动等的行为。","pronunciation":["연ː기"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"ebf90bac22cca4cd","term":"별로","zh":"特别，格外","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3","entryId":"58301","definition":"特殊额外地；或指那么不同地。","pronunciation":["별로"]}],"audio":"/audio/932e2fd221e114a31482.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14484-2-7-2","ko":"아직 병아리 배우라 그렇겠지.","zh":"应该还只是个新人演员吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"병아리","meaning":"雏鸡，新人","explanation":"병아리：雏鸡，新人","readings":[{"term":"병아리","audio":"/audio/04513e84ecfd8f762231.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14484","senseId":"2","lemma":"병아리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배우라","meaning":"演员","explanation":"배우：演员；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"배우","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58204","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇겠지.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"04513e84ecfd8f76","term":"병아리","zh":"雏鸡，新人","audio":"/audio/04513e84ecfd8f762231.mp3","entryId":"14484","definition":"(喻义)开始做某事没多久、处理事务不够熟练的人。","pronunciation":["병아리"]},{"id":"70129359d515b770","term":"배우","zh":"演员","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3","entryId":"58204","definition":"担任电影、话剧或电视剧等中的人物角色进行表演的人。","pronunciation":["배우"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/69bda887ad5b1744e750.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.805,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14484","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":128,"sequenceScore":2.4026,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["应该还只是个新人演员吧。","这里如果没人，我能坐吗？","那个人好像是没见过的演员吧？演技有点差啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["应该还只是个新人演员吧。","那个人好像是没见过的演员吧？演技有点差啊。","这里如果没人，我能坐吗？"],"answer":0}]}
